{"ID":"20240205153812-9p5arf8","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153812-9p5arf8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153812-9p5arf8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205160705-89997xz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140357-8vgzcq5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205160705-89997xz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:255,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:255\u0026#125;","title":"芦荟","type":"doc","updated":"20240902160539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205160705-89997xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160705-89997xz","updated":"20240206140413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t百合科植物库拉索芦荟Aloe barbadensis Miller、好望角芦荟Aloe ferox Miller或其他同属近缘植物叶的汁液浓缩干燥物。库拉索芦荟习称“老芦荟”，好望角芦荟习称“新芦荟”。\n【产地】\t主产非洲北部、南美洲西印度群岛等地。\n【性状】\t库拉索芦荟：呈不规则块状，常破裂为多角形，大小不一。表面呈暗红褐色或深褐色，无光泽。体轻，质硬，不易破碎，断面粗糙或显麻纹。富吸湿性。有特殊臭气，味极苦。\n好望角芦荟：表面呈暗褐色，略显绿色，有光泽。体轻，质松，易碎，断面玻璃样而有层纹。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清肝热，通便。用于便秘，小儿疳积，惊风；外治湿癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140357-8vgzcq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140357-8vgzcq5","updated":"20240206140357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140357-k8sw5qd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724082906-i1453ap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724082906-i1453ap","updated":"20240724082906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芦荟 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芦荟 5-20240724082906-d2x5vsw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724082819-59rnqxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724082819-59rnqxo","updated":"20240724082819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芦荟 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芦荟 4-20240724082819-whov911.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724084115-vc9hv4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724084115-vc9hv4o","updated":"20240724084115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 726px;","style":"width: 716px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芦荟 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/芦荟 12-20240724084115-bdhv5g0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 716px;\" parent-style=\"width: 726px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724083412-o0ola11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724083412-o0ola11","updated":"20240724083412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 727px;","style":"width: 717px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"芦荟 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data